    "privacy.local": {
      "comment": "Release readiness: recovery, progression, privacy or support. Preserve format placeholders.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your career, inventory, simulated conversations, inspection knowledge and settings are stored on this device. Your profile name and avatar stay local. Sellers and buyers are fictional characters, not other people."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kariyerin, envanterin, kurgusal konuşmaların, inceleme bilgin ve ayarların bu cihazda saklanır. Profil adın ve avatarın yerel kalır. Satıcılar ve alıcılar gerçek kişiler değil, kurgusal karakterlerdir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Karriere, dein Inventar, simulierte Gespräche, Fachwissen und Einstellungen werden auf diesem Gerät gespeichert. Profilname und Avatar bleiben lokal. Verkäufer und Käufer sind fiktive Figuren, keine anderen Personen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta carrière, ton stock, les conversations simulées, tes connaissances et tes réglages restent sur cet appareil. Ton nom et ton avatar restent locaux. Les vendeurs et acheteurs sont des personnages fictifs."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu carrera, inventario, conversaciones simuladas, conocimientos de inspección y ajustes se guardan en este dispositivo. El nombre y avatar del perfil permanecen locales. Los vendedores y compradores son personajes ficticios, no otras personas."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Carriera, inventario, conversazioni simulate, competenze d'ispezione e impostazioni restano su questo dispositivo. Nome e avatar del profilo restano locali. Venditori e acquirenti sono personaggi fittizi, non altre persone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.tracking": {
      "comment": "Release readiness: recovery, progression, privacy or support. Preserve format placeholders.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are no ads, tracking tools, analytics SDKs, player-account registration or developer-operated servers in the game. Gameplay data is not sent to the developer."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oyunda reklam, takip aracı, analiz SDK’sı, oyuncu hesabı kaydı veya geliştiricinin işlettiği sunucu yoktur. Oyun verileri geliştiriciye gönderilmez."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Spiel enthält keine Werbung, Tracking-Tools, Analyse-SDKs, Spielerkontenregistrierung oder vom Entwickler betriebenen Server. Spieldaten werden nicht an den Entwickler gesendet."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jeu ne contient ni publicité, ni suivi, ni SDK d’analyse, ni inscription de compte joueur, ni serveur exploité par le développeur. Les données de jeu ne lui sont pas envoyées."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El juego no incluye anuncios, rastreo, SDK de análisis, registro de cuentas de jugador ni servidores del desarrollador. Los datos de juego no se envían al desarrollador."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il gioco non include pubblicità, tracciamento, SDK di analisi, registrazione di account giocatore o server dello sviluppatore. I dati di gioco non vengono inviati allo sviluppatore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.apple": {
      "comment": "Release readiness: recovery, progression, privacy or support. Preserve format placeholders.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If online Game Center features are enabled, connecting is optional. Apple handles your Game Center account, submitted scores and achievements. The game keeps an Apple player identifier locally to protect result ownership. Apple’s services follow Apple’s privacy policy."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Çevrimiçi Game Center özellikleri etkinse bağlanmak isteğe bağlıdır. Game Center hesabını, gönderilen puanları ve başarımları Apple yönetir. Oyun, sonuçların sahipliğini korumak için Apple oyuncu kimliğini yerel olarak saklar. Apple hizmetlerinde Apple’ın gizlilik politikası geçerlidir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Falls Online-Funktionen des Game Center aktiviert sind, ist die Verbindung freiwillig. Apple verwaltet dein Konto, übermittelte Punkte und Erfolge. Das Spiel speichert eine Apple-Spielerkennung lokal, um Ergebnisse dem richtigen Konto zuzuordnen. Für Apple-Dienste gilt Apples Datenschutzrichtlinie."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si les fonctions Game Center en ligne sont activées, la connexion est facultative. Apple gère ton compte, les scores envoyés et les succès. Le jeu conserve localement un identifiant Apple pour attribuer les résultats au bon compte. Les services Apple suivent sa politique de confidentialité."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si se activan las funciones en línea de Game Center, conectarse es opcional. Apple gestiona tu cuenta de Game Center, las puntuaciones enviadas y los logros. El juego guarda un identificador de jugador de Apple localmente para proteger la propiedad de los resultados. Los servicios de Apple siguen su política de privacidad."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se le funzioni online di Game Center vengono attivate, la connessione è facoltativa. Apple gestisce l'account Game Center, i punteggi inviati e gli obiettivi. Il gioco conserva localmente un identificativo giocatore Apple per tutelare la titolarità dei risultati. I servizi Apple seguono la sua informativa sulla privacy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "privacy.control": {
      "comment": "Release readiness: recovery, progression, privacy or support. Preserve format placeholders.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications require your permission and can be disabled in iOS Settings. Device backups may include game data depending on your Apple backup settings. Deleting the app, rather than offloading it, removes its local game files and recovery backups. Manage Game Center separately in your Apple account settings."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bildirimler iznini gerektirir ve iOS Ayarlar’dan kapatılabilir. Apple yedekleme ayarlarına bağlı olarak cihaz yedekleri oyun verilerini içerebilir. Uygulamayı arşivlemek yerine silmek, yerel oyun dosyalarını ve kurtarma yedeklerini kaldırır. Game Center’ı Apple hesabı ayarlarından ayrıca yönetebilirsin."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mitteilungen benötigen deine Erlaubnis und lassen sich in den iOS-Einstellungen deaktivieren. Gerätesicherungen können je nach Apple-Einstellungen Spieldaten enthalten. Wenn du die App löschst statt auszulagern, werden lokale Spieldateien und Wiederherstellungssicherungen entfernt. Game Center verwaltest du separat in deinen Apple-Kontoeinstellungen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les notifications nécessitent ton accord et se désactivent dans les réglages iOS. Les sauvegardes de l’appareil peuvent inclure les données du jeu selon tes réglages Apple. Supprimer l’app, plutôt que la décharger, efface les fichiers locaux et leurs copies de récupération. Gère Game Center séparément dans les réglages de ton compte Apple."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las notificaciones requieren tu permiso y se pueden desactivar en Ajustes de iOS. Las copias del dispositivo pueden incluir datos del juego según tus ajustes de copia de Apple. Eliminar la app, en lugar de desinstalarla conservando los datos, borra los archivos locales del juego y sus copias de recuperación. Gestiona Game Center aparte en los ajustes de tu cuenta de Apple."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le notifiche richiedono il tuo consenso e si possono disattivare nelle Impostazioni iOS. I backup del dispositivo possono includere dati di gioco secondo le tue impostazioni Apple. Eliminare l'app, anziché rimuoverla conservando i dati, cancella i file locali e le copie di recupero. Gestisci Game Center separatamente nelle impostazioni dell'account Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
